// @name         TORN Daily Resource Tracker
// @namespace    https://torn.com/
// @version      1.0.0
// @description  Stop guessing your daily progress. Track Energy, Nerve, Xanax, City Shop, Casino Tokens, refills, cooldowns, Organized Crimes and travel/OC timing in one compact dashboard. Especially useful for faction daily requirements. Read-only, uses the official Torn API. Needs a Full Access API key for all features, including energy and nerve usage.
// @author       Arxenel [4390395]
// @match        https://www.torn.com/*
// @grant        GM_getValue
// @grant        GM_setValue
